  unitName: Hail Shadow Farzen
  unitId: 20725
  unitNumber: 1204
  description: A swordsman who lived during the dawn of Elgaia. It is said that some
    priests from a great shrine in Grand Gaia chased after Farzen during his travels,
    and asked him to join the newly established Randall Guard. By the time Farzen
    had joined the group, his real name and lineage remained as big a mystery as
    they had before. Besides slaying demonic beasts, however, records state that
    Farzen simultaneously carried out secret missions for the government. Rumor has
    it his ice-like blade showed no mercy to any who dared disrupt the peace.
  summonDesc: Hmm? Are you confusing me<br>with [[Colt|someone else]]?<br>Because
    you guessed wrong.
  fusionDesc: I want to continue being strong.<br>I don't wish for any further regrets.<br>Haha,
    I must sound like an old man.
  evoDesc: Have I grown more powerful?<br>The power he meant for the future...<br>Never
    mind me, I'm just mumbling.
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
